@startuml Get_Assigned_Classes
title Activity Diagram - Get Assigned Classes

|Instructor|
start
:Open Instructor Dashboard;
:Click "View My Classes";

|Web Application|
:Send request to retrieve\nassigned classes;

|Backend API|
:Extract instructorId\nfrom JWT token;
:Call ClassService.\nGetAssignedClassesAsync(instructorId);
:Query database:\nGet classes where\ninstructorId = {id};
:Include related data:\n- Instructor\n- Semester\n- ClassEnrollments\n- Groups\n- Projects;

if (Classes found?) then (yes)
  :Map entities to DTOs\n(ClassResponseDto);
  :Return List<ClassResponseDto>;
  :Send 200 OK response;
else (no)
  :Return empty list;
  :Send 200 OK response;
endif

|Web Application|
if (Response successful?) then (yes)
  :Display list of classes\nwith details\n(ClassName, Semester, TotalStudents, TotalGroups);
else (no)
  :Display error message;
  stop
endif

|Instructor|
:View assigned classes list;
stop
@enduml

